Configuration (Base URL & Model Parameter)\n\n\nWith the recent update in Copilot Chat v1.99 allowing users to bring their own API keys for providers such as Azure, Anthropic, Gemini, OpenAI, Ollama, and Open Router, it would be beneficial to extend this flexibility further by enabling a custom configuration for OpenAI. This feature would allow users to specify a custom base URL and model parameter directly in the Copilot Chat interface.\n\nFeature Details:\n\nCustom Base URL:\nAllow users to provide a custom base URL for the OpenAI API. This is especially helpful for users who may be working with self-hosted instances or region-specific endpoints.\n\nCustom Model Parameter:\nAdd an option to specify a preferred model parameter. This would enable users to configure and test various models (including newly released or experimental ones) without waiting for native support.\n\nThis feature will make Cursor and Windsurf useless.","closed_by":{"login":"lramos15","id":4544166,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NDQxNjY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4544166?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lramos15","html_url":"https://github.com/lramos15","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lramos15/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lramos15/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lramos15/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lramos15/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lramos15/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lramos15/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lramos15/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lramos15/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lramos15/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":true},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/7518/reactions","total_count